## API reference

| Part | Props | Description |
|------|-------|-------------|
| `PreviewCard` | `delay:` (600), `close_delay:` (300), `default_open:` | The root. |
| `PreviewCardTrigger` | `href:` + anchor attributes; block `{ \|link\| … }` | The link. |
| `PreviewCardContent` | `side:`, `align:`, `side_offset:`, `align_offset:`, `arrow:` | The card (Popover's). |
